{"title":"Wolf Meat","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Sand Jackal, Wolf, Desert Wolf, Dune Alpha, Dire Wolf +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"old-ironjaw\" title=\"Old Ironjaw - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/3bef5a178dddce39a254.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Ironjaw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"desert-wolf\" title=\"Desert Wolf - dropped it in 3 of 4 looted corpses (1/1.3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/c329d1e5ab8da9dd114c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Desert Wolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"sand-jackal\" title=\"Sand Jackal - dropped it in 39 of 55 looted corpses (1/1.4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/bb7ca40cbe335f3fe02d.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Jackal</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dune-alpha\" title=\"Dune Alpha - dropped it in 3 of 5 looted corpses (1/1.7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a30ad945729791035484.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Alpha</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"wolf\" title=\"Wolf - dropped it in 20 of 35 looted corpses (1/1.8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/b92e598cd76ddc4d4330.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.8<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dire-wolf\" title=\"Dire Wolf - dropped it in 3 of 8 looted corpses (1/3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d535eb40d6ac5fcfceaa.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dire Wolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×2–3</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"wolf-meat\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/cooking\">Cooking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/cooked-wolf-meat\">Cooked Wolf Meat</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Cooking 2</span></li></ul>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"Wolf Meat\"></div><h3>Wolf Meat</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>6 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Used in</th><td>1 recipe</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/23/2026, 9:28:41 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}